[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31100400_01_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31100400_01_0002","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31100400_01_0004","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31100400_01_0005","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31100400_01_0007","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31100400_01_0009","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31100400_01_0010","text":"这边灯饰，缠好了！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31100400_01_0020","text":"那么……接下来是挂饰……\n树里小姐……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31100400_01_0021","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31100400_01_0030","text":"啊，就是那个\n树顶上的星星怎么找不着了……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31100400_01_0031","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31100400_01_0040","text":"诶……！\n装饰在顶上的星星，没有了吗……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31100400_01_0050","text":"那可是大事呢……\n我们分头找找吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31100400_01_0051","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31100400_01_0055","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31100400_01_0060","text":"这边是雪花的装饰！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31100400_01_0070","text":"这边是花环……\n会在哪里呢……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31100400_01_0071","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31100400_01_0080","text":"────不好意思，剩下的活儿能交给你们吗？\n我和果穗一起去仓库那边找找"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31100400_01_0090","text":"好，知道了\n我会把事务所的装饰也完美搞定的，放心吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31100400_01_0091","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31100400_01_0100","text":"大家，拜托了\n────走吧，树里酱……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31100400_01_0101","text":"Motion"}]
